Bearing in mind that {\LARGE\wan{3}} of {\LARGE\wan{3}\wan{5}\wan{6}\wan{7}} is more valuable than isolated {\LARGE\wan{3}}, consider the following hand. 
\begin{itembox}[r]{Hand with a skipping shape}
\bp
